<title>NETHERLANDS: Wesselius upgrades Grontmij to Buy.</title>
<headline>Wesselius upgrades Grontmij to Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of October research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Grontmij	  Engineering   38.50   Wesselius</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (from Sell). Restructuring of Grontmij's environmental consultancy arm, outsourcing and improved project management are seen generating cost savings of 17.5 million guilders from next year.  Engineering and other services to book stable profits, leading to 1997 group net of some 25 million. Grontmij should trade on a similar multiple to construction firms, giving it a fair value of 65 guilders and thus upward potential of 68 percent in 1.5 years.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E</p>
<p>    1996		   3.85     1.11     10.1</p>
<p>    1997		   6.78     1.25	5.8</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
